Vendored model: SFace face recognition (ONNX)
==============================================

This directory contains a redistributed copy of the SFace face-recognition
ONNX model, vendored so VoiceLock can compute face embeddings fully offline
(no runtime network; loaded via cv2.FaceRecognizerSF.create(model_asset_path=...)).

