Threshold note
--------------
OpenCV's published SFace operating point (cosine >= 0.363, L2 <= 1.128) is
adopted as-is by src/voicelock/faceprint.py rather than measured on this
repo's own fixtures -- see that module and spec.md Q5 for the reasoning.
This NOTICE records only the model's provenance and licence, not the
threshold decision.
